== Trivia ==
* This item quote is a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Yoshi's Island|Yoshi's Island]]'' level 1-7: ''"Touch Fuzzy Get Dizzy"''.
* [[wikipedia:Psilocybe semilanceata|Psilocybe semilanceata]], commonly known as "Liberty Cap", is widely present in nature and is a very powerful psychedelic mushroom which contains [[wikipedia:Psilocybin|psilocybin]].
* The Liberty Cap's ability to grant the Compass effect was a bug in the original ''Binding of Isaac'' which was carried over due to popularity with the fans.
* The pickup quote for the Chinese translation (一摸一起躺板板) is a reference to a popular meme [https://youtu.be/3Iqir-pcjTo|meme]

